        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo goodiing'diing'da aba roonyeeda Esawu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat Yakobo gawa ak gwaroonyi sea malaykajeega ASEETA; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean nea ghwadaah Yakobo malaykajeegiga gwayi, “Suh lugooda ASEETA!” Ak gaguura gheawungeaba ng'eanyiita Mahanaimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goojeakta Yakobo giijasoodiga goosheeda gaweay heeda Esawu was orjeeda ghaamwat aba ng'eanyiida Seyiri, was ng'eanyiida Edomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoanaal gideaba, “Asi ayeeshiina ng'utamiideanyu was Esawu: Gwayi soomjeandaang'u was Yakobo, ‘Neandeawi Labani nea geawooschi rabascheanda ea ghoah ghamneawa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geandeawi heewga, ea digeeniga, ea gisilga, ea nooga, ea soomjooga was headiga, ea gadeemga was soomjooga, ak geajeakti gwarukusa ng'utamiideanyu iita, ak abeeda ghaanyaschi alooheeda aba madeadaang'u.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hit gabiigu fuga siicheakta heeda Yakobo ak gwayeesha, “Geeleabu heeda orjeeda geamadu was Esawu, nea ghwaan roonyeadaang'u, nea goodeana fih bughalaji ang'wan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghabeal Yakobo muuchi nea gagiisan; ak gageanu ghwalach bugusta fuga mideawa niba iyeenya ea hawanda, ea dugwa ea ngamiyajeega, nea gwayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iihidu Esawu ak ghabwar geeda madeeda, abeeda geeda abit gaygamng'aw.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi Yakobo, “Ea ASEETA bwaabwa was Abrahamu ea ASEETA bwaabwa was Isaka, Ea NG'UTAMIIDA eeshiinean, ‘Biikta ng'eang'deang'wa ea heeda buweadeagaagu, ak gaydasineey gidamiy’, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mamiisean eara gilimwanang' aba alooheeda isinnean aniineeda was soomjeandaang'u, aba gideaba aniini ghaaghaawi Yordani nea ghaaghuschi bileangida; ak ghamneawa ea naang'achi niba iyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geamuscheey lealnean ang'iing'i, aba geatinda orjeediyya, aba geatinda Esawu, aba gideaba aniini ghaawali niny aba gideaba gajiidu ghwahidu ak ghabwareasa eesa sean, gheamadiga ea diibiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadu giyeeni, ‘Gaydasin ng'asheega miyaas, ak ghaanung' gwadeena jeacheangaagu iseaskweanda basooda, mwoamu eeyiida aba seang'ayda.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwalla hoowa eaweedida, ak ghwaat gidamideawa jea ghoadaw orjeeda ghaamwat was Esawu ghoah haleanjeeda guskuseega, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nooga seaweadi bughalaji iyeenya ea ghwaray diktam, gisilga seaweadi bughalaji iyeenya ea lagweendi diktam, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngamiyajeega eanooga diktam ea damanamughuush ea dayeega nyaawa, dugwa seaweadi haradam ea jiiru damanamughuush, digeeniga seaweadi diktam ea jiiru damanamughuush bea digeeniga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwayiin haleanjeeni seaniin geatinga soomjoagaaschi, ak gaba hawanyeanji bwaageaw, ak gwayeesha soomjoagaaschi, “Oosheedeawanean ak goosinyi dageascheeda gooheeli hawaniga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwarukusa siida haweewa soomjooga gideaba, “Iihidu orjeeda giyeanya was Esawu roonyeedeang'wa, ak ghoanyaasheagwa gideaba, ‘Goobeayiing'a? Googali yeenu? Ak gaba ng'eaha haleanjeeni oondeawiin?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gooyeeshi, ‘Gaba soomjeandaang'u was Yakobo; suh gaba guskuseega siyaat heeda ng'utamiideanya was Esawu; nea niny ghwaan gweadu geeshteanya.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwarukusa siideaba iyeenya ea deaba samwagu ea fuga sean adeayi hawaniga, “Gajarukusiina ng'asheandida Esawu iyooroonyeewi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gajayeeshiina, ‘Ak eara soomjeandaang'u was Yakobo ghwaan gweadu geeshteanya.’” Aba gideaba ghaghay gili jea “ghahawda nyarasta aba haleanjeeda guskuseega mida madeedeanyu, ak abeeda ghaadaayi gheanyangaaschi; gwadeepa abeeda ghamwasan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwaat haleanjeeda guskuseega; ak gwalla eaweedida jeeda maheemajeanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo gabeanyi aba Benueli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweedida ghang'eat ak ghwaat gadeamgaaschi asiyeenya, ea haweagaaschi asiyeenya was gwealajeega sea diibigaaschi attamwanagi, ak ghoaghaawa eenda Yaboki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwaat sean ea ghoaghaawa ghealooda, sea haleanjeeda sean mideawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geanung'wa heeda Yakobo nea gaba geaw; sea siida beanyi sea niny ea ghwariikghta gaweeshiit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daah siidida gideaba moamu ghwajoar Yakobo ghawaas dughulumda; hean ghwaliy geeshta Yakobo damanda beanyeewa sea niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha, “Nung' dawa, aba gideaba niweeshiit.” Ghwalamda Yakobo ak gwayeesha, “Maydanung' una, ea eaghus goonean ghawooda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha niny, “Gheawungaagu ng'eaha?” Gwayeesha, “Geeguureewanean Yakobo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha, “Gheawungaagu maygudu eeguureewaneey Yakobo, gajeeguureewaneey Israeli, aba gideaba ning'alealeewi ASEETA ea buuneeda, ak ea nijooriischi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
