          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoanyaash Yakobo niny nea gwayeesha, “Geamuscheey rukunean gheawungaagu.” Gwayeesha niny, “Ghwasaan anda giinyaashti gheawungeasu?” Ng'ata ghoadaw ghawooda Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu gaguura Yakobo gheawungeaba ng'eanyiita Benueli, nea gwayi, “Naadaayi ASEETA aba gheanyangeasu, ak ea nukwa gutanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goorearu aseeta damanda beawa Yakobo Benueli, nea gwajikta aba gideaba ghwaak gibeesta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
